  "hard_rules": [
    "wow-store depends only on wow-core and never interprets domain semantics",
    "one exact SQLite WAL epoch and one writer owner in v1",
    "partition versions and published generation manifests are immutable",
    "every generation has a complete membership map and no recursive delta chain",
    "project graph analyzer and store identities form a noncyclic exact binding",
    "target commits inactive and passes fresh read-back validation before activation",
    "activation is a separate stale-base compare-and-swap transaction",
    "readers bind one exact SQLite snapshot and never switch generations",
    "current last-known-good failed-target and rollback identities never relabel",
    "checkpoint WAL and physical bytes never alter logical identities",
    "breaking schema runtime or physical profile changes build a new epoch",
    "retention and GC require complete generation partition object and lease closure",
    "no raw SQL extension attach filesystem escape process network editor client or source execution",
    "row absence never becomes domain negative authority",
    "missing probes benchmarks or checksums are blocking and never reported pass"
  ],
